<div class="disclaimer">
  <p>Attorney Menu collects the information you submit through registration, case-intake, and lead forms — including name, email, phone, case description, and IP address for security purposes — in order to operate the directory and connect you with participating attorneys.</p>
  <p>Payment information for paid features (attorney Q&amp;A, contract purchases) is processed by Stripe and is not stored on our servers. Uploaded documents (ID verification, contract files) are stored privately and are never made public.</p>
  <p>We do not sell your personal information. Information may be shared with a participating attorney when you submit a request that involves them, or with service providers who help us operate the site (payment processing, cloud storage, anti-spam verification).</p>
  <p>You can unsubscribe from email updates at any time using the link included in those emails, or by contacting <a href="mailto:support@attorneymenu.com">support@attorneymenu.com</a>.</p>
